# Feature: Invitation Welcome Flow

**Goal**: As a person invited to Gurudevi, I want to see a personalized welcome screen so I feel part of the community immediately.

## Scenario: Principal invites a Teacher to a School
  **Given** I have a deep link for a "School" invitation from "Principal Silva" at "Royal College"
  **And** the welcome message is "Welcome to our team!"
  **When** I open the app via this link
  **Then** I should see the "Royal College" logo or icon
  **And** I should see "Welcome to Royal College!"
  **And** I should see "Principal Silva has invited you to join the Gurudevi teacher community"
  **And** I should see the message "Welcome to our team!"
  **And** I should see a "Continue" button

## Scenario: Alumni gifts Pro membership (Thuthimal)
  **Given** I have a deep link for a "Thuthimal" gift from "Kasun Perera"
  **And** the gift includes "Pro access for 1 year"
  **And** the message is "Thank you for believing in me, sir."
  **When** I open the app via this link
  **Then** I should see the "Lotus" animation
  **And** I should see "තුතිමල් (Flower of Gratitude)"
  **And** I should see that "Kasun Perera" has gifted me "Pro access for 1 year"
  **And** I should see the quote "Thank you for believing in me, sir."
  **And** I should see an "Accept Gift & Continue" button

## Scenario: Invalid or Expired Invitation
  **Given** I have a deep link that has already been used or is expired
  **When** I open the app via this link
  **Then** I should see an "Invitation Invalid" error message
  **And** I should see a button to "Contact Support"
  **And** I should see a button to "Enter Invite Code Manually"
